  "Meet the personalities and fursonalities behind WTAKO Network": "認識 WTAKO Network 背後的人物與毛物",
  "Full-stack Developer · 1995 · Male · Hong Kong": "全端開發者 · 1995 · 男 · 香港",
  "Languages": "語言",
  "Cantonese, English, Mandarin, TypeScript, Python, C++": "廣東話、英語、國語、TypeScript、Python、C++",
  "Hobbies": "興趣",
  "Hardware, Coding, Monster Hunter, Riichi Mahjong, Music composing, AI": "硬體、編程、魔物獵人、日麻、音樂創作、AI",
  "I don't know if it's a good idea to mix up a server's home page and a furry's home page.": "我不知道把伺服器首頁和毛毛的主頁混在一起是不是個好主意。",
  "But by the way, when I was young, I was intoxicated by many anime aired on TV. I was most affected by American Dragon: Jake Long, Legendz, and Onmyou Taisenki. The animators definitely knew what they were doing, and they won.": "不過說到這裡，我從小看很多電視動畫看到中毛毛毒，影響最深的是《美國龍：傑克龍》、《Legendz》和《陰陽大戰記》。動畫師顯然知道自己在做什麼，他們贏了。",
  "As a result, I was obsessed with dragons. I wanted to be friends with them. I wanted to be them. However, dragons nowadays are symbols of bravery and power, which really was not who I was.": "所以我對龍著迷，想和牠做朋友，想變成牠們的一分子。然而，現在的龍代表勇敢與有力量，而我其實不是那樣的人。",
  "Cats, on the other hand, are elusive and elegant. The strongest variants of cats are, no doubt, tigers or saber-toothed tigers. A white tiger is the only existing one out of the four sacred beasts. I cannot take its form for the same reason I did not consider dragons to resemble me, but at the same time, I do not like house cats because they are pets. I want to be wild. Therefore, lynxes.": "貓另一方面則讓我感到神祕優雅。貓科動物中戰力最強的無庸置疑是老虎或劍齒虎，而白虎更是四聖獸中唯一現實存在的。我不會用牠們的形象，原因和不會龍一樣：因為牠們太強大，我沒資格。可是，同時我也不想用家貓代表自己，因為牠們是寵物。我想要野性，所以選了山貓。",
  "Lynxes can be cute or cool. They always look very smart, although reality usually differs. I do not want to be completely wild. Instead, I like aristocracy and tribal aesthetics, and that's why my lynx character fursona looks either tribal or regal in my imagination.": "山貓可以可愛也可以帥氣。牠們總是看起來很聰明，儘管現實往往並非如此。我想要野性但我又不想要完全野性，我很喜歡貴族與部落美學，所以我的山貓角色在我的妄想中不是部落風格就是皇家風格。",
  "Kokumo is a lovable and huggable furred dragon, and he is very close with Saren. I did not think of it when designing him, but now I think this is a form of compensation for my childhood self, who did not make friends with dragons.": "刻雲是一隻可愛又適合擁抱的毛龍，他和沙雲關係非常親密。設計他時我並沒有想到這一點，但現在我想：這是對小時候沒能和龍做朋友的那個自己的一種彌補。",
  "On the other hand, Inerri Creatures made my fursuit back in 2019. She is very talented.": "另一方面，我的毛裝是 2019 年由 Inerri Creatures 製作的。她非常有才華。",
  "Get in Touch": "聯絡方式",
  "GitHub": "GitHub",
  "Twitter": "Twitter",
  "Email": "電郵",
  "Which is actually an excuse to travel everywhere just to avoid his 9-to-5 job in his palace. He does not really care about being a Crown Prince and thinks other heirs are better than him at ruling, anyway.": "這其實是到處旅行的藉口，只是為了避免宮殿裡的朝九晚五工作。他對當太子沒興趣，反正也覺得其他繼承人比他更厲害也更懂得治國。",
  "Kokumo: He is always right, especially the &quot;other heirs are better&quot; part.": "刻雲：他說的一點也沒錯，特別是「其他繼承人比他更厲害」那部分。",
  "When Saren, the Crown Prince, is busy having fun and neglecting his duties, Kokumo follows him everywhere. Guess who takes care of Saren's food and clothes?": "當太子沙雲忙著玩樂、忽略作為皇室成員的責任時，刻雲就跟在他身邊。猜猜是誰負責照顧沙雲的起居飲食？",
  "Saren: He is as useful as mom.": "沙雲：他像媽媽一樣有用。",
